        "convertedHtml": "<div class=\"slide-content\">\n<!-- Hero Section con imagen de fondo -->\n<div class=\"hero-section\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(67, 106, 177, 0.92) 0%, rgba(20, 27, 89, 0.88) 100%), url('images/image_1.jpg') center/cover;\">\n<div class=\"hero-content\">\n<div class=\"hero-badge\">\n<span style=\"color: white; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem;\">✨ Powered by AI</span>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"hero-title\">Desarrollo de Cursos<br>Responsivos con IA</h2>\n<p class=\"hero-description\">Sistema de desarrollo de cursos e-learning responsivos, rápidos de producir y compatibles con cualquier LMS.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Features Grid -->\n<div class=\"feature-grid\">\n<div class=\"card-feature\" style=\"border-top: 4px solid var(--color-primary);\">\n<div class=\"icon-box-lg\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, var(--color-primary-dark) 100%);\">📱</div>\n<h4>100% Responsivo</h4>\n<p>Adaptable a cualquier dispositivo: móvil, tablet o escritorio. Una experiencia perfecta en todas las pantallas.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card-feature\" style=\"border-top: 4px solid var(--color-secondary);\">\n<div class=\"icon-box-lg\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-secondary) 0%, #3ea18c 100%);\">⚡</div>\n<h4>Producción Rápida</h4>\n<p>Acelera el desarrollo con IA.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card-feature\" style=\"border-top: 4px solid var(--color-accent-alt);\">\n<div class=\"icon-box-lg\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-accent-alt) 0%, #d85d95 100%);\">🔌</div>\n<h4>Universal LMS</h4>\n<p>Compatible con cualquier plataforma LMS del mercado. Implementación sin complicaciones.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Stats Section -->\n<div class=\"stats-section\">\n<div class=\"stats-grid\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"stat-value\" style=\"color: var(--color-primary);\">2x</div>\n<div class=\"stat-label\">Más Rápido</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"stat-value\" style=\"color: var(--color-secondary);\">100%</div>\n<div class=\"stat-label\">Adaptable</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"stat-value\" style=\"color: var(--color-accent-alt);\">∞</div>\n<div class=\"stat-label\">Plataformas</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
