700; margin: 0;\">Formato Curso Responsivo IA</h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"comparison-body\">\n<div class=\"stat-display\">\n<div style=\"color: var(--color-secondary); font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;\">50</div>\n<div class=\"stat-label\">horas totales</div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; background: #e8f3e8; color: #2d7738; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 0.8rem;\">✓ 50% menos tiempo</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border-top: 2px solid var(--bg-light); padding-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<ul class=\"hours-list\">\n<li class=\"hours-list-item\">\n<span>📝 Diseño Instruccional:</span>\n<strong style=\"color: var(--color-secondary);\">15 hrs</strong>\n</li>\n<li class=\"hours-list-item\">\n<span>🎨 Diseño Gráfico:</span>\n<strong style=\"color: var(--color-secondary);\">25 hrs</strong>\n</li>\n<li class=\"hours-list-item\">\n<span>🔄 Revisiones/ajustes:</span>\n<strong style=\"color: var(--color-secondary);\">10 hrs</strong>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"height: 350px; margin: 2rem 0;\">\n<img src=\"images/image_4.jpg\" alt=\"Comparación de tiempos de desarrollo\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"benefits-box\">\n<div class=\"benefits-box-content\">\n<div class=\"icon-box-lg\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary) 0%, var(--color-primary-dark) 100%); font-size: 2rem;\">🚀</div>\n<div>\n<h4 style=\"color: var(--color-primary-dark); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Ventajas del formato responsivo</h4>\n<ul class=\"benefits-list\">\n<li>✓ <strong style=\"color: var(--text-primary);\">Menos tiempo de producción</strong></li>\n<li>✓ <strong style=\"color: var(--text-primary);\">Mayor control del proceso</strong></li>\n<li>✓ <strong style=\"color: var(--text-primary);\">Cursos listos para cualquier LMS</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"alert-warning\">\n<div class=\"alert-warning-content\">\n<div class=\"alert-warning-icon\">⚠️</div>\n<div>\n<h5 style=\"color: var(--color-primary-dark); font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;\">¡Importante!</h5>\n<p style=\"color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Los tiempos no consideran desarrollo de recursos extras como incorporar videos, animaciones o gráficas completas.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
