        "convertedHtml": "<div class=\"slide-content\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 3rem;\">\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Hacia dónde vamos</h2>\n<h3 style=\"color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Modelo de desarrollo propuesto</h3>\n<p class=\"section-subtitle\">Combinar lo mejor de los mundos en el desarrollo de cursos</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"chart-container\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) 0%, rgba(247, 250, 252, 0.85) 100%), url('images/image_5.jpg') center/cover;\">\n<div class=\"pie-chart-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"pie-chart\" style=\"background: conic-gradient(var(--color-secondary) 0deg 288deg, var(--color-accent) 288deg 360deg);\">\n<div class=\"pie-chart-center\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; font-weight: 600;\">Total</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-primary); line-height: 1;\">100%</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.3rem;\">del contenido</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pie-label\">\n<div class=\"pie-label-badge\" style=\"background: var(--color-secondary); box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(73, 190, 166, 0.4);\">80%</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pie-label\">\n<div class=\"pie-label-badge\" style=\"background: var(--color-accent); box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(247, 193, 70, 0.4);\">20%</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"legend-grid\">\n<div class=\"legend-card\" style=\"border-left: 6px solid var(--color-secondary);\">\n<div class=\"legend-header\">\n<div class=\"icon-box-md\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-secondary) 0%, #3ea18c 100%); font-size: 1.8rem;\">🤖</div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"color: var(--color-secondary); font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1;\">80%</div>\n<div class=\"stat-label\">del contenido</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h4 style=\"color: var(--color-primary-dark); font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;\">Contenido IA</h4>\n<p style=\"color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">La mayor parte del curso se desarrolla con tecnología de IA, permitiendo producción rápida, escalable y de alta calidad.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"legend-card\" style=\"border-left: 6px solid var(--color-accent);\">\n<div class=\"legend-header\">\n<div class=\"icon-box-md\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-accent) 0%, #e0a43b 100%); font-size: 1.8rem;\">🎬</div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"color: var(--color-accent); font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1;\">20%</div>\n<div class=\"stat-label\">del contenido</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h4 style=\"color: var(--color-primary-dark); font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.8rem;\">Videos o animaciones</h4>\n<p style=\"color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Elementos multimedia estratégicos que complementan y enriquecen la experiencia de aprendizaje en puntos clave.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-gradient-bg\" style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 2rem; animation: fadeInUp 1s ease-out 0.7s both;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">✨</div>\n<h4 style=\"color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">El equilibrio perfecto</h4>\n<p style=\"color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">Combinamos la eficiencia de la IA con el impacto de contenido multimedia estratégico, creando cursos efectivos y atractivos en tiempo récord.</p>\n</div>\n</div>"
